            <div class="ctl-sub-txt" style="color:#5ef2d6;margin-top:2px">Th\u01B0\u1EDFng th\u1EAFng tr\u1EADn: +${c.stones} Nguy\xEAn Th\u1EA1ch \xB7 +90 Tu Vi \xB7 Tinh Luy\u1EC7n L\xF4i \u0110\xE0i</div>
